{"name": "Deck of Memories", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"676\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/bbc78bc4921bfc5bbb42f76bbb916384.poster.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/bbc78bc4921bfc5bbb42f76bbb916384.webm?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/bbc78bc4921bfc5bbb42f76bbb916384.mp4?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Deck of Memories blends card-based gameplay with an evocative tale about fading memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Mina, a young woman returning to her grandfather's post at the lighthouse. Looking through his belongings, she discovers a wondrous deck of handcrafted cards. Suddenly, scenes from a memory begin to emerge\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/a337b19dc0c374ed14b7baedc5bb7800.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"109\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/fe8c0afead270ed50c8bbe7ede93edee.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"652\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/9b0a1d0b2814d55b92f3bc5fd2dbb6ce.poster.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/9b0a1d0b2814d55b92f3bc5fd2dbb6ce.webm?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/9b0a1d0b2814d55b92f3bc5fd2dbb6ce.mp4?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each short story features multiple card encounters on an immersive diorama board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new gameplay twists across every diorama, from shifting tides to moving machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine your cards carefully to stabilize the memory, and recover every detail before it fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/5a848a1b2ad9b0bc586ae1653248a91a.webp?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"109\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/c61a88575968e9ca460c54f3b5621c32.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"652\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/2274329d7e0d04821c73e8841de3f1b3.poster.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/2274329d7e0d04821c73e8841de3f1b3.webm?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/2274329d7e0d04821c73e8841de3f1b3.mp4?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tinker with cards at the crafting table using your grandfather's old supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and attach various trinkets to discover powerful synergies and refine your deck for greater versatility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend memory shards to unlock new cards, crafting tools, and other curious collectibles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/5a848a1b2ad9b0bc586ae1653248a91a.webp?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"109\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/8a0b34c40fed57b4f3628f521d07c43b.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/99fae29d0d7a4428d9d63619d9ae55b4.poster.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/99fae29d0d7a4428d9d63619d9ae55b4.webm?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/99fae29d0d7a4428d9d63619d9ae55b4.mp4?t=1787857292\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What Deck of Memories offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original, soft take on deckbuilding with lots of nostalgia baked in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collection of lovely short stories based on thoughtfully designed card encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Campaign-style playthrough inspired by Inscryption Part 1 and Hearthstone Adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calming atmosphere and beautiful artstyle, fully hand-painted (no AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seamless blend of strategic and relaxing gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many unlockable cards, trinkets and tools</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/5a848a1b2ad9b0bc586ae1653248a91a.webp?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What Deck of Memories is <u>not</u>:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike (difficult challenges and endless runs)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced, combat-heavy or violent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walking Simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200bMultiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/5a848a1b2ad9b0bc586ae1653248a91a.webp?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"109\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/2ed2f3df3c3db3820d19cd769fd48c37.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist now to get notified when the demo is out, and try for yourself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/a65c2059d8141a6ce36d8a7d68005ea9.webp?t=1787857292\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"145\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/a65c2059d8141a6ce36d8a7d68005ea9.poster.avif?t=1787857292\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Deck of Memories is a nostalgic deckbuilding adventure about the stories your grandfather left behind. Explore fragments of his life as a lighthouse keeper, manifested inside atmospheric dioramas. Craft and combine cards to restore these memories and discover the secrets they hold.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/a2bf3e9dc7238350fc921848876ece796051a976/header.jpg?t=1787857292", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Nostalgia", "Atmospheric", "Adventure", "Strategy"], "developers": "Sentiment Games", "publishers": "Sentiment Games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3056570", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/msbb-jGYMOQ", "first_seen": 1772751600.0, "review_rank": 1037}